id: moon-guardian
name: Moon Guardian
advancement: true
prerequisite: N/A
tpCost: 5
# The table's (the user's ruling), as everything that attacks the False Moon is.
source: Core Rule
description: >
  The False Moon targeted by an attack with no AoE: a Counter Action to step beside it and take the attack yourself.
text: >
  Moon Guardian: You use your body to shield the full moon you’ve created.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –TP Cost: 5
  –Effect: If your False Moon is targeted by an Attacking Maneuver that does not possess an AoE, you may spend a
  Counter Action to move to an adjacent Square to that False Moon. If you do, shift the target of that Attacking
  Maneuver to you.
